  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Future for Buds Network</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The BUDS Network project, established in 2007, was a program designed to provide care and support to children living with HIV/AIDS. A group was formed between these children and other willing, able members of the community, in order to reduce social stigma and discrimination and build support networks. The project focuses on three main areas; educational progression, physical education and life-skills.</narrative>
  </description>
